# Pure compile+run (no compile server). Self-contained: a plain
# `haxe test.hxml` always rebuilds and runs, with no dependency on any
# out-of-band process. See test-server.hxml for the --connect 7822
# opt-in speed variant: a stray/mismatched server already listening on
# that port answers `--connect` without error and skips the build
# entirely (exit 0, no bin/test.n written, no output) - this file
# avoids that failure mode by never connecting to one.
test-common.hxml
-neko bin/test.n
--cmd neko bin/test.n
